Mon Nov  9 14:20:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Replace outwiker-respect-gtk-theme.patch with
  outwiker-avoid-dark-gtk-theme.patch: GTK_THEME is no longer set
  at all, so the theme from XSETTINGS/settings.ini is used; once GTK
  is up, a dark theme is swapped for its light variant ("Foo-Dark"
  -> "Foo-Light" or "Foo") or Adwaita, and the dark-theme
  preference is turned off.  An explicit GTK_THEME is respected.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Nov  9 14:10:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of OutWiker 4.1.0.982 (tag 4.1.0-stable),
  replacing the Flatpak
  * Installed like upstream's Makefile (/usr/share/outwiker), with
    the official plugins and their bundled libraries
  * outwiker-respect-gtk-theme.patch: only default GTK_THEME to
    ":light" instead of overriding the user's theme
  * outwiker-system-hunspell-dicts.patch: also offer the system
    hunspell dictionaries from /usr/share/hunspell
  * Own launcher without the "cd /usr/share/outwiker" of upstream's
  * Desktop file installed as net.jenyay.Outwiker.desktop (matching
    the AppStream metadata), with StartupWMClass
